<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Global Direct raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Global Direct raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Global DirectMail Corp to buy from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Global Direct closed Wednesday at 28-5/8.</p>
</text>
